<content contentuid="h536092bbg7779g55ccg85b7gd675a7325986" version="1">踏入灵界并出现在18米内的另一处。</content>
<content contentuid="hf1ed520dgaf9fg50edgb003g2c215b414bcb" version="1">灵界步</content>
<content contentuid="h319378c5g4ef9g55a7ga328g1c139faeb1fd" version="1">你窥见了命运的可能性。豁免检定+2，攻击检定+2。</content>
<content contentuid="he484363fge785g5919gb1c5g690b63bc6bf6" version="1">占卜</content>
<content contentuid="h4e20a4abg16a2g511agbd4dgbcdfadd56307" version="1">窥视命运的支流。3回合内豁免检定与攻击检定+2。</content>
<content contentuid="h4aa80458g9b46g5a89gaa54ga47510ec8a31" version="1">占卜</content>
<content contentuid="hb855377aged75g5de3ga0abga9f99a18f04f" version="1">你行走于星界，移动速度+3米。</content>
<content contentuid="h6c0084d6gea2bg54f7gb039ge0dde1d8f135" version="1">星界行走</content>
<content contentuid="hc819b8e5gc7c5g5ac7g95ffgd18232d21394" version="1">你的步伐折叠了空间，移动速度+3米。</content>
<content contentuid="hb9b88b99g8b43g5a11ga21fg06b68fc12442" version="1">闪现</content>
<content contentuid="he0b1f3beg3062g5d17gb812ge590448d6d38" version="1">你记录万物之理，所有豁免检定+1。</content>
<content contentuid="h988fae12g0f5cg5e36gb841gd65a09b736c4" version="1">记录官</content>
<content contentuid="h219b57edg8bd2g5a60gbc0ag27bad8d61488" version="1">你对空间的感知使先攻+2。</content>
<content contentuid="hed158e93gf8e8g5f07gbb5eg0245d6bbdf64" version="1">空间感知</content>
<content contentuid="hb742badcgd60dg5742ga58bgc458041296c3" version="1">你即是门。护甲等级+2，豁免检定+1。</content>
<content contentuid="h7fc8a4d6g1591g5c19gacaege4cd105377d5" version="1">门</content>
<content contentuid="h733c0c70ga3e3g51cbg8e2ega9d99f928509" version="1">你的谎言近乎真实，所有豁免检定+2。</content>
<content contentuid="h5a01b566ga125g50dfgaa9bg0ff93fe58ce7" version="1">诈骗师</content>
<content contentuid="h5eba8ba1gc057g5101gaa4fg94b95cb86766" version="1">你寄生他人的命运，武器伤害+1d6暗蚀。</content>
<content contentuid="hcff4e3ccg2dc5g586dga306g2a2d07082895" version="1">寄生者</content>
<content contentuid="h39969f02g953dg5ff0g98c3g5e3c720bff41" version="1">你成为世界的一个错误。护甲等级+2，攻击检定+2。</content>
<content contentuid="hab87c928g752cg508aga295g4b284c160540" version="1">错误</content>
<content contentuid="h0a7005fcg34cdg5ec5gb819g53e280e784bf" version="1">你惯于窃取，所有技能检定+1。</content>
<content contentuid="hcef5d8f3ga90bg54acg92a3ge80af04affac" version="1">偷盗者</content>
<content contentuid="hf20b48feg1160g54ddg8e30gaedb148726da" version="1">时间在你身上错位，先攻+3。</content>
<content contentuid="h69aaf6cfg7679g54e0ga9e9g98c3ff218989" version="1">时之虫</content>
<content contentuid="hbae79ee5g5d1fg5204g8611g7e399240bf3b" version="1">你不再拥有固定的面孔，先攻+2。</content>
<content contentuid="hd8b5c738ga721g5e09gb5aeg12e8c7886c57" version="1">无面人</content>
<content contentuid="h6ce42bb7g83dfg556cg8ab9gfaba6fa49f7f" version="1">你能窥见命运的支流，所有豁免检定+2。</content>
<content contentuid="h9d917552g1e21g529cg9a96g240c85a3668c" version="1">命运窥视</content>
<content contentuid="ha56d1017g6f40g5f79gb605g2d024f8a79ef" version="1">你行奇迹如呼吸，护甲等级+2。</content>
<content contentuid="h105e615cg51a2g5b2bg9779gc51bd9e40e28" version="1">奇迹师</content>
<content contentuid="hf9ee25b9g5d7dg57a4gabf3g745dc505ff8a" version="1">你以扮演掩盖真实，所有技能检定+1。</content>
<content contentuid="h2e9ec539ga2f7g595fga34bgfb60386f41f4" version="1">扮演法</content>
<content contentuid="h8fc6de1dg4fdcg5befga9ddg29f1b61421ad" version="1">护甲等级+1，所有豁免检定+1。</content>
<content contentuid="h56896fa6g6ac3g5ac2g8e73gffc7445fc9b5" version="1">源堡高阶庇佑</content>
<content contentuid="h5bc91ac2g501dg5d11g8a98g8f57b05f6118" version="1">你短暂地执掌诡秘权柄。护甲等级+2，攻击检定获得优势。</content>
<content contentuid="hd9d97fccg089cg57c2ga89bgc0098dfbc61d" version="1">诡秘权柄</content>
<content contentuid="he6274a50g7529g50bdg8f0agfbce9ccf0e1b" version="1">短暂执掌诡秘权柄。5回合内护甲等级+2，攻击检定获得优势。</content>
<content contentuid="hc0eed83cgc303g5e62g94e1ge7388b84e990" version="1">诡秘权柄</content>
<content contentuid="h4f23053dgfd2ag51f8ga709g88b606a96698" version="1">你已成为源堡的代行者。护甲等级+2，豁免检定+2，攻击检定+2。</content>
<content contentuid="h89750c74g5579g5a02gaa62g5701aec8edb6" version="1">诡秘之主</content>
<content contentuid="hd227d3dagcec1g515dg8351gf94bc9de2502" version="1">非凡特性改造了你的躯体，获得暗蚀伤害抗性。</content>
<content contentuid="ha1fdddc7gfff3g5644gbfcfg4e969184a043" version="1">非凡韧性</content>
<content contentuid="hfe918925g7756g5ea8g8863g64034d85cc8e" version="1">灵性凝成的屏障环绕着你。护甲等级+2。</content>
<content contentuid="h4f0e3a05g4db9g5b8fg9e38g546c947e9a01" version="1">灵性屏障</content>
<content contentuid="h335cb8fdgd576g59a9g9087g2339e17a2ddf" version="1">源堡的力量在你周身凝成无形的屏障，护甲等级+1。</content>
<content contentuid="h2aab7579g5494g5afeg86e7g6fd32de5138f" version="1">源堡庇佑</content>
<content contentuid="h3e6773dfg101ag5dacg89a3g8ce1ef4a8f56" version="1">打开通往源堡的门，传送至远处。</content>
<content contentuid="h68c92fd2gff4cg5a68g890egbb1f885d2f46" version="1">源堡之门</content>
<content contentuid="hed521247ged17g591dg9908gbbbca78dfd8a" version="1">与源质共鸣，灵性上限+1，护甲等级+1。</content>
<content contentuid="ha48f5a70g2f7fg5948g924bg1d3e0ea1e1b5" version="1">源质共鸣</content>
<content contentuid="h167a0260g1e48g58b9g8c61g0b01812cae2e" version="1">以灵性凝成屏障，3回合内护甲等级+2。</content>
<content contentuid="h05f5c475gbb6fg5e40g8887g7d87e28d06f6" version="1">灵性屏障</content>
<content contentuid="hd2090a3dgd0f8g50caga94cgb4f7e7834426" version="1">灵性上限+1。</content>
<content contentuid="he3dfb749gf516g5c4cga5c4g033d90f782b3" version="1">灵性涌动</content>
<content contentuid="hbc4241c4ge7eag5579g9520g6d17d44aecc4" version="1">源堡是“诡秘之主”的源质，一座悬于灵界之上的古老城堡。侍奉源堡的非凡者行走于命运、空间与错误的缝隙之间，以灵性为代价换取超越凡俗的力量。</content>
<content contentuid="h537bcbaeg900dg5478g9b05g4e59da1db60a" version="1">源堡</content>
<content contentuid="h6dd7cefagc444g5a90gb02bgd622d6f6646c" version="1">门途径：学徒、戏法大师、星术师、记录官、旅行家、秘法师、漫游者、星之舟、知识皇帝。掌控空间、传送与知识。</content>
<content contentuid="h8dc4eb4cg7cd9g5b72g849ege7c8e2f5adc4" version="1">门</content>
<content contentuid="h0893e782gd1d1g54f1g86e3g43e46773faa3" version="1">错误途径：偷盗者、诈骗师、解密学者、盗火人、窃梦家、寄生者、暗箱、时之虫、命运之蛇。窃取、寄生与时间错位。</content>
<content contentuid="hf56836edg9238g5142g8c96ga1347a0fb3dc" version="1">错误</content>
<content contentuid="hf2f3b5b4g86edg593fga129gb7a452fc6bf6" version="1">愚者途径：占卜家、小丑、魔术师、无面人、秘偶大师、诡术师、古代学者、奇迹师、诡秘侍者。以扮演与命运窥视操纵战局。</content>
<content contentuid="h8b2fd73cg8e05g555fg83d6g2c4595a637e1" version="1">愚者</content>
<content contentuid="h0d4eb6a1gbdacg5c57gb807ge5350ef9a804" version="1">源堡非凡者以灵性驱动非凡能力。短休后恢复。</content>
<content contentuid="h8111fa9egd521g5d3ag9794g3b9547caea84" version="1">灵性</content>
